    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator that adds a label to any element with alignment. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an element and adds a text label either to the left (single line) or above (multi-line).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
